          <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">2</span>
          
          
        <sup id="footnotex2.1" class="ltx_sup"><math id="footnotex7.m1a" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ddagger\lx@sectionsign" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">‡</mo><mi>§</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ddagger\lx@sectionsign</annotation></semantics></math></sup>These authors contributed equally, ordered by last name.</span></span></span>
